{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>And they carried them</b> — two times: וישאום בכתנותם, וישאום בני קיש אחיהם. One who marries a wife is obligated to clothe her, as written: וכסותה לא יגרע (and her clothing he shall not diminish), and this is וישאום בני קיש and וישאום בכתנותם — since they married them they become obligated in their garments."], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:19:05.183254106Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}